{"id":"n71290-1-8","stage":1,"title":"아름답다 · 美丽","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71290-1-8-1","ko":"설악산에서 내려다보는 경치가 그렇게 아름답다며?","zh":"据说从雪岳山往下看的景色非常美丽吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"설악산에서","meaning":"雪岳山","explanation":"설악산：雪岳山；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"설악산에서","audio":"/audio/022acac113aaf0e4fa83.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"설악산에서","audio":"/audio/022acac113aaf0e4fa83.mp3"}},{"text":"내려다보는","meaning":"俯视，俯瞰","explanation":"내려다보다：俯视，俯瞰；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"내려다보다","audio":"/audio/5d3a414e57deae6683f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64372","senseId":"1","lemma":"내려다보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내려다보는","audio":"/audio/7b9b55fb55517abbb8f0.mp3"}},{"text":"경치가","meaning":"风景，景色","explanation":"경치：风景，景色；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"경치","audio":"/audio/b590a66bb114caf5d529.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26024","senseId":"1","lemma":"경치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경치가","audio":"/audio/6f73ac164259b7c92e48.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"아름답다며?","meaning":"美丽，漂亮","explanation":"아름답다：美丽，漂亮；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"아름답다","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71290","senseId":"1","lemma":"아름답다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아름답다며","audio":"/audio/f6ebd1bf13836e908761.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5d3a414e57deae66","term":"내려다보다","zh":"俯视，俯瞰","audio":"/audio/5d3a414e57deae6683f3.mp3","entryId":"64372","definition":"由上往下看。","pronunciation":["내려다보다"]},{"id":"b590a66bb114caf5","term":"경치","zh":"风景，景色","audio":"/audio/b590a66bb114caf5d529.mp3","entryId":"26024","definition":"自然或地区美丽的样子。","pronunciation":["경치"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"b39be518859c28e0","term":"아름답다","zh":"美丽，漂亮","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3","entryId":"71290","definition":"对象、嗓音或颜色等令眼睛和耳朵都感到愉快和满足。","pronunciation":["아름답따"]}],"audio":"/audio/9b0a1712de3d97b95669.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71290-1-8-2","ko":"응, 한 폭의 그림이 따로 없다니까.","zh":"对，简直就像一幅画一样美啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个，同一","explanation":"한：一个，同一。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"4","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"폭의","meaning":"幅","explanation":"폭：幅；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"폭","audio":"/audio/a986625d9a2fb282eb38.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73265","senseId":"4","lemma":"폭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"폭의","audio":"/audio/86d9d40cd6883938dad8.mp3"}},{"text":"그림이","meaning":"画儿","explanation":"그림：画儿；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"2","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그림이","audio":"/audio/342ddbc2cfa82085a895.mp3"}},{"text":"따로","meaning":"另行，别的，不同地","explanation":"따로：另行，别的，不同地。","readings":[{"term":"따로","audio":"/audio/6d325aa9f77b0fc574c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"